#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:6
msgid "Algorithm"
msgstr "探索アルゴリズム"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:8
msgid ""
"`saealib` separates candidate generation from feedback consumption and "
"places that contract in `Algorithm`. Replace an `Algorithm` with "
"`Optimizer.set_algorithm(algorithm)`."
msgstr ""
"`saealib` は候補生成とフィードバックの消費を分離し、その契約を `Algorithm` にまとめます。 `Algorithm` は "
"`Optimizer.set_algorithm(algorithm)` で差し替えられます。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:11
msgid ""
"The current `Algorithm` contract combines a Proposer that generates "
"candidates and a FeedbackConsumer that consumes evaluation results. Users"
" do not need to think about this contract during ordinary use. Implement "
"the following state boundaries only when you are building a custom search"
" algorithm."
msgstr ""
"現行の `Algorithm` は、候補を生成するProposerと、評価結果を消費するFeedbackConsumerを兼ねる契約です。 "
"通常の利用では、利用者がこの契約を意識する必要はありません。 独自の探索アルゴリズムを実装するときだけ、次の状態境界を実装します。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:15
msgid "Algorithm's role"
msgstr "Algorithmの役割"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:17
msgid ""
"`Algorithm` receives a read-only `StateView` and returns results without "
"changing state directly."
msgstr "`Algorithm` は、読み取り専用の `StateView` を受け取り、状態を直接変更せずに結果を返します。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:19
msgid ""
"**`ask(request, state) -> ProposalBatch`**: Generates a candidate batch "
"from `ProposalRequest` and `StateView`. When `request.n_offspring` is "
"`None`, the algorithm determines the candidate count from the current "
"Population."
msgstr ""
"**`ask(request, state) -> ProposalBatch`**：`ProposalRequest` と "
"`StateView` から候補のバッチを生成します。 `request.n_offspring` が `None` "
"の場合の候補数は、アルゴリズムが現在のPopulationから決定します。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:22
msgid ""
"**`tell(feedback, state) -> StatePatch`**: Consumes a `FeedbackBatch` and"
" returns the state changes to apply as a `StatePatch`. `tell()` does not "
"modify `OptimizationState` or `Population` directly."
msgstr ""
"**`tell(feedback, state) -> StatePatch`**：`FeedbackBatch` を消費し、適用すべき状態変更を"
" `StatePatch` として返します。 `tell()` は `OptimizationState` や `Population` "
"を直接変更しません。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:25
msgid ""
"This separation leaves the decision about which candidates receive "
"expensive true evaluations outside `Algorithm`. That decision belongs to "
"the combination of "
"[OptimizationStrategy](../execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md), the "
"evaluation plan, and `FeedbackPolicy`."
msgstr ""
"この分離によって、どの候補を高コストな真の評価へ送るかを `Algorithm` の外側に置けます。 その判断は "
"[OptimizationStrategy](../execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md) "
"と評価計画、`FeedbackPolicy`の組み合わせが担います。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:28
msgid "Built-in Algorithms"
msgstr "組み込みAlgorithm"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md
msgid "Class"
msgstr "クラス"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md
msgid "Search method"
msgstr "探索手法"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md
msgid "`GA`"
msgstr "`GA`"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md
msgid "Genetic algorithm via crossover and mutation"
msgstr "交叉と突然変異による遺伝的アルゴリズム"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md
msgid "`PSO`"
msgstr "`PSO`"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md
msgid "Particle swarm optimization via velocity and position updates"
msgstr "速度と位置の更新による粒子群最適化"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md
msgid "`GenomeGA`"
msgstr "`GenomeGA`"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md
msgid "Genetic algorithm that handles the `SearchSpace` Genome directly"
msgstr "`SearchSpace`のGenomeを直接扱う遺伝的アルゴリズム"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:36
msgid ""
"`GenomeGA` is an Algorithm on the Genome-native path that uses the "
"`GenomeBatch` and `SearchSpace` contracts. It preserves the Genome "
"representation and space services instead of implicitly converting them "
"to the same `x` column path used by fixed-width dense-vector `GA`."
msgstr ""
"`GenomeGA` は、`GenomeBatch` と `SearchSpace` の契約を使うGenome-"
"native経路のAlgorithmです。 固定幅のdense vectorを前提とする `GA` と同じ `x` "
"列の経路へ暗黙に変換せず、Genomeの表現と空間サービスを維持します。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:39
msgid "GA: a container that combines operators"
msgstr "GA：演算子を組み合わせるコンテナ"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:41
msgid ""
"`GA` itself has no search logic; it's a container assembled by injecting "
"four operators: "
"`crossover`/`mutation`/`parent_selection`/`survivor_selection`."
msgstr "`GA`自体には探索ロジックがなく、`crossover`/`mutation`/`parent_selection`/`survivor_selection`という4つの演算子を注入して組み立てるコンテナです。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:51
msgid ""
"The behavior and parameters of each operator are covered on their own "
"dedicated pages."
msgstr "各演算子の動作とパラメータは、それぞれの専用ページで説明します。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:53
msgid "[Crossover](crossover.md): Generates offspring from parent individuals"
msgstr "[Crossover](crossover.md)：親個体から子個体を生成します。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:54
msgid "[Mutation](mutation.md): Adds perturbation to offspring"
msgstr "[Mutation](mutation.md)：子個体に摂動を加えます。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:55
msgid ""
"[ParentSelection](parent_selection.md): Chooses the parent individuals "
"used for crossover"
msgstr "[ParentSelection](parent_selection.md)：交叉に使う親個体を選びます。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:56
msgid ""
"[SurvivorSelection](survivor_selection.md): Chooses the individuals kept "
"for the next generation"
msgstr "[SurvivorSelection](survivor_selection.md)：次世代に残す個体を選びます。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:58
msgid ""
"`variation_execution` selects batch or sequential execution for crossover"
" and mutation, and a dictionary can control them independently. Batch is "
"the default; for the full operation/hook ordering and reproducibility "
"semantics, see the `GA` API reference below."
msgstr ""
"`variation_execution`は交叉と突然変異のバッチ実行または逐次実行を選択し、辞書でそれぞれを個別に制御できます。既定値はバッチです。操作・フックの完全な順序と再現性の仕様については、下記の`GA`"
" APIリファレンスを参照してください。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:61
msgid ""
"`GA.tell()` combines the current Population and the candidates generated "
"by `ask()` in one pool, then selects the next Population with "
"`survivor_selection`. This corresponds to a $(\\mu+\\lambda)$-style "
"update. What goes into the pool (whether parents are included) is `GA`'s "
"own responsibility, and doesn't appear in `SurvivorSelection`'s interface"
" itself."
msgstr "`GA.tell()`は現在の個体群と`ask()`が生成した候補を1つのプールにまとめ、`survivor_selection`で次の個体群を選びます。これは$(\\mu+\\lambda)$型の更新に相当します。プールに何を入れるか（親を含めるかどうか）は`GA`自身の責務であり、`SurvivorSelection`のインターフェース自体には現れません。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:65
msgid "GA: handling mixed-variable problems"
msgstr "GA：混合変数問題"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:67
msgid ""
"For problems whose design variables mix integer and categorical "
"variables, `GA` uses type-specific operators in addition to the "
"`crossover`/`mutation` for continuous variables. If "
"`integer_crossover`/`integer_mutation`/`categorical_crossover`/`categorical_mutation`"
" are omitted, "
"`CrossoverIntegerSBX`/`MutationIntegerUniform`/`CrossoverCategorical`/`MutationCategorical`"
" are supplied automatically, respectively. The probability parameters "
"(`prob`/`prob_var`) of the automatically supplied operators are inherited"
" from the continuous-variable `crossover`/`mutation`."
msgstr "設計変数に整数変数とカテゴリ変数が混在する問題では、`GA`は連続変数用の`crossover`/`mutation`に加えて、型ごとの演算子を使います。`integer_crossover`/`integer_mutation`/`categorical_crossover`/`categorical_mutation`を省略すると、それぞれ`CrossoverIntegerSBX`/`MutationIntegerUniform`/`CrossoverCategorical`/`MutationCategorical`が自動的に設定されます。自動設定された演算子の確率パラメータ（`prob`/`prob_var`）は、連続変数用の`crossover`/`mutation`から引き継がれます。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:71
msgid ""
"Even for operators supplied per type, `n_children`/`n_parents` must match"
" the continuous-variable `crossover`. A mismatch raises "
"`ConfigurationError`. This is because `GA` splits parent individuals into"
" columns by variable type, applies each operator only to its "
"corresponding columns, and then reassembles the results into a single "
"individual — an implementation under which the number of children and "
"parents must not diverge between types. The default batch mode calls each"
" type-specific operator's batch method on its columns. "
"`variation_execution=\"sequential\"` uses the earlier per-pair/per-"
"individual routing and preserves its random-number sequence."
msgstr "型ごとに設定する演算子でも、`n_children`/`n_parents`は連続変数用の`crossover`と一致しなければなりません。一致しない場合は`ConfigurationError`を送出します。これは、`GA`が親個体を変数型ごとの列に分割し、対応する列にだけ各演算子を適用してから、結果を1つの個体に再構成するためです。この実装では、型によって子個体数と親個体数を変えられません。既定のバッチモードでは、各型専用演算子のバッチメソッドをその列に対して呼び出します。`variation_execution=\"sequential\"`では従来のペア単位・個体単位の振り分けを使い、乱数列を維持します。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:77
msgid ""
"Variable types are defined via "
"[Problem](../problem_and_ranking/problem.md)'s `variables` argument."
msgstr ""
"Variable types は defined via "
"[Problem](../problem_and_ranking/problem.md)'s `variables` argument.。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:79
msgid "GA: auxiliary utilities"
msgstr "GA：補助ユーティリティ"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:81
msgid ""
"Passing `DuplicateElimination(atol=1e-16, rtol=0.0, max_retries=100)` to "
"the **`duplicate_elimination`** argument replaces offspring that "
"duplicate the current population by regenerating them. The tolerance for "
"duplicate detection is given by `atol`/`rtol`, and the maximum number of "
"regeneration attempts by `max_retries`. If omitted (the default `None`), "
"no duplicate elimination is performed."
msgstr ""
"**`duplicate_elimination`**引数に`DuplicateElimination(atol=1e-16, rtol=0.0,"
" "
"max_retries=100)`を渡すと、現在の個体群と重複する子個体を再生成して置き換えます。重複検出の許容誤差は`atol`/`rtol`で、再生成の最大試行回数は`max_retries`で指定します。省略した場合（既定値は`None`）、重複除去は行われません。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:85
msgid ""
"`saealib.repair_clipping(candidates, bounds)` is a standalone utility "
"function that simply `np.clip`s a set of candidates into `(lb, ub)`. `GA`"
" itself repairs candidates via "
"[ConstraintHandler](../problem_and_ranking/constraints.md)'s `repair()` "
"(which also defaults to `np.clip`) and `Problem.repair()` (per-`Variable`"
" projection); `repair_clipping` is not automatically wired into GA's "
"internal processing. It's exposed for cases where you want the same "
"clipping behavior standalone — for example, when writing a custom "
"evaluation pipeline that doesn't go through `ConstraintHandler`."
msgstr ""
"`saealib.repair_clipping(candidates, bounds)`は、候補集合を`(lb, "
"ub)`に単純に`np.clip`する独立したユーティリティ関数です。`GA`自身は[ConstraintHandler](../problem_and_ranking/constraints.md)の`repair()`（これも既定では`np.clip`）と`Problem.repair()`（`Variable`ごとの射影）を通じて候補を修復します。`repair_clipping`はGAの内部処理に自動接続されません。`ConstraintHandler`を通らないカスタム評価パイプラインを書く場合など、同じクリッピング動作を単独で使いたいときのために公開されています。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:89
msgid "PSO"
msgstr "PSO法"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:91
msgid ""
"`PSO(w=0.7, c1=1.5, c2=1.5, v_max=None)` updates velocity using weights "
"for the inertia term `w`, attraction to the personal best `c1`, and "
"attraction to the swarm best `c2`, then advances position by that "
"velocity. Specifying `v_max` clamps each dimension's velocity magnitude "
"to that value."
msgstr ""
"`PSO(w=0.7, c1=1.5, c2=1.5, "
"v_max=None)`は、慣性項`w`、個体最良値への誘引`c1`、群最良値への誘引`c2`の重みを使って速度を更新し、その速度で位置を進めます。`v_max`を指定すると、各次元の速度の大きさをその値に制限します。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:94
msgid ""
"Unlike `GA`, it isn't assembled by injecting operators — `ask()`/`tell()`"
" directly perform the velocity and position updates and track each "
"particle's pbest (personal best). The swarm best (leader) is chosen from "
"all particles' pbests using `ctx.comparator`, so any single-objective "
"`Comparator` is automatically supported. Multi-objective PSO (MOPSO) "
"requires a dedicated subclass that manages a non-dominated solution set; "
"the built-in `PSO` targets single-objective problems."
msgstr "`GA`と異なり、演算子を注入して組み立てるものではありません。`ask()`/`tell()`が速度と位置の更新を直接行い、各粒子のpbest（個体最良値）を追跡します。群最良値（リーダー）は`ctx.comparator`を使って全粒子のpbestから選ぶため、任意の単目的`Comparator`を自動的に利用できます。多目的PSO（MOPSO）には、非劣解集合を管理する専用サブクラスが必要です。組み込みの`PSO`は単目的問題を対象とします。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:98
msgid "External library adapters"
msgstr "外部ライブラリアダプタ"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:100
msgid ""
"`PymooAlgorithm(pymoo_algorithm, *, allow_partial_tell=False)` wraps an "
"already-constructed [pymoo](https://pymoo.org/) algorithm (e.g. "
"`NSGA2()`, `DE()`) so an existing pymoo algorithm can drive saealib's "
"ask-tell loop and surrogate-assisted strategies unchanged."
msgstr ""
"`PymooAlgorithm(pymoo_algorithm, *, "
"allow_partial_tell=False)`は、構築済みの[pymoo](https://pymoo.org/)アルゴリズム（例：`NSGA2()`、`DE()`）をラップし"
"、既存のpymooアルゴリズムでsaealibのask-tellループとサロゲート支援戦略を変更せずに動かせるようにします。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:102
msgid ""
"Unlike `GA`/`PSO`, which treat `ctx.population` as the source of truth, "
"`PymooAlgorithm` runs in \"engine mode\": the wrapped pymoo algorithm "
"owns its own population and internal survival state, and `ctx.population`"
" is refreshed from it at the end of every `tell()` — a mirror, not the "
"source of truth. This is the only way to reuse a pymoo algorithm's own "
"tested survival logic unchanged, but it comes with real limits worth "
"knowing before reaching for it:"
msgstr ""
"`GA`/`PSO`は`ctx.population`を正本とみなしますが、`PymooAlgorithm`は「エンジンモード」で動作します。ラップしたpymooアルゴリズムが独自の個体群と内部の生存状態を保持し、各"
" `tell()` "
"の終了時に`ctx.population`がそこから更新されます。これは正本ではなくミラーです。pymooアルゴリズム自身の検証済みの生存選択ロジックを変更せずに再利用する唯一の方法ですが、利用前に知っておくべき実際の制約があります。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:105
msgid ""
"No checkpoint/resume — `OptimizationState.save()` only serializes "
"saealib's own arrays, not the wrapped algorithm's internal state."
msgstr ""
"チェックポイントからの保存・再開には対応しません — `OptimizationState.save()` "
"はsaealib独自の配列だけをシリアライズし、ラップしたアルゴリズムの内部状態は対象にしません。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:106
msgid ""
"`n_offspring` passed to `ask()` is ignored; the offspring count is fixed "
"by the wrapped algorithm's own configuration (e.g. its `pop_size`)."
msgstr "`ask()`に渡した`n_offspring`は無視されます。子個体数はラップしたアルゴリズム自身の設定（例：`pop_size`）で固定されます。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:107
msgid ""
"`PreSelectionStrategy`'s top-k truncation hands `tell()` only a subset of"
" what `ask()` produced. By default this raises `ConfigurationError`, "
"since index-coupled algorithms (e.g. differential evolution) would "
"silently misalign parents and offspring under a partial `tell()`; pass "
"`allow_partial_tell=True` to opt in anyway."
msgstr "`PreSelectionStrategy`の上位k件への打ち切りでは、`ask()`が生成したものの一部だけを`tell()`に渡します。既定では`ConfigurationError`を送出します。インデックスに依存するアルゴリズム（例：差分進化）では、部分的な`tell()`により親と子個体の対応が気付かないままずれるためです。それでも許可する場合は`allow_partial_tell=True`を渡します。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:109
msgid ""
"See [Installation](../../getting_started/installation.md) for the `pymoo`"
" extra."
msgstr ""
"`pymoo` "
"extraのインストールについては[インストール](../../getting_started/installation.md)を参照してください。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:111
msgid "Implementing a custom Algorithm"
msgstr "独自Algorithmの実装方法"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:113
msgid ""
"To implement a custom search algorithm, subclass `Algorithm` and "
"implement `ask()` and `tell()`. Implement `get_required_attrs()`, "
"`population_class`, and `archive_class` as well when using the existing "
"Population compatibility path."
msgstr ""
"独自の探索アルゴリズムを実装するときは、`Algorithm` を継承して `ask()` と `tell()` を実装します。 "
"`get_required_attrs()`、`population_class`、`archive_class` "
"も、既存のPopulation互換経路を使う場合には実装が必要です。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:116
msgid ""
"In a new implementation, `ask()` returns a `ProposalBatch`, and `tell()` "
"returns a `StatePatch`. `state` is a `StateView` that can access only "
"declared state keys. Candidate counts, candidate IDs, and the mapping to "
"evaluation results follow the `ProposalBatch` and `FeedbackBatch` "
"contracts."
msgstr ""
"新しい実装では、`ask()` は `ProposalBatch` を返し、`tell()` は `StatePatch` を返します。 "
"`state` は宣言された状態キーだけを参照できる `StateView` です。 候補数、候補ID、評価結果の対応付けは "
"`ProposalBatch` と `FeedbackBatch` の契約に従います。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:120
msgid ""
"The following skeleton shows only the boundaries a custom Algorithm "
"implements."
msgstr "次の骨格は、独自Algorithmが実装する境界だけを示しています。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:153
msgid ""
"The Feedback received by `tell()` preserves its evaluation path and its "
"mapping to candidate IDs. Whether the algorithm requires only true "
"evaluations or accepts predictions is declared by its contract and "
"`FeedbackPolicy`. Persistent auxiliary information such as PSO's pbest is"
" handled as a Population attribute or a declared `StateKey`."
msgstr ""
"`tell()` が受け取るFeedbackは、どの評価経路から届いたかと、候補IDとの対応を保持します。 "
"真の評価だけを必要とするか、予測値を受け入れるかは、Algorithmの契約と`FeedbackPolicy`で宣言します。 "
"PSOのpbestのような永続的な補助情報は、Population属性または宣言済みの`StateKey`として扱います。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:157
msgid "Related components"
msgstr "関連コンポーネント"

