#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:160
msgid ""
"[Problem](../problem_and_ranking/problem.md): Defining mixed variables "
"via `variables`"
msgstr "[Problem](../problem_and_ranking/problem.md)：`variables`による混合変数の定義"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:161
msgid ""
"[ConstraintHandler](../problem_and_ranking/constraints.md): The "
"`repair()` that `GA` uses to repair candidates"
msgstr ""
"[ConstraintHandler](../problem_and_ranking/constraints.md): `repair()` "
"that `GA` uses へrepair 候補s。"

#: ../../concepts/search_algorithms/algorithm.md:162
msgid ""
"[OptimizationStrategy](../execution_and_evaluation/strategies.md): "
